---
import { retention, site } from "../config";
---

<div class="panel summary">
  <h2>In short</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>We don't ask for an account, email or phone number.</li>
    <li>There are no ads, analytics or tracking.</li>
    <li>
      Online play only uses the name you type, and games delete themselves after {retention.gameHours} hours.
    </li>
    <li>We don't sell or share data with anyone.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<section>
  <h2>Who is responsible</h2>
  <p>
    {site.developer}, an independent developer in Colombia, is the data controller for {site.storeName}.
    For any question, write to <a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`}>{site.contactEmail}</a>.
  </p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>What data is used and why</h2>
  <div class="table-scroll">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Data</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Kept for</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>Player name (up to 20 characters, whatever you type)</td>
          <td>Showing it to your opponent in an online game</td>
          <td>Deleted after {retention.gameHours} hours</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Game code and in-game balances</td>
          <td>Running the online game</td>
          <td>Deleted after {retention.gameHours} hours</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Technical connection identifier</td>
          <td>Sending moves to each phone and letting you reconnect</td>
          <td>Up to {retention.connectionHours} hours</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Server error logs</td>
          <td>Finding and fixing problems</td>
          <td>{retention.logDays} days</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <p>Playing on one phone sends nothing over the internet.</p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>What is stored on your phone</h2>
  <p>
    Your settings (sound, vibration, language), your last player name and a private key to get back into an
    online game if the connection drops. All of it is removed when you uninstall the app.
  </p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Where data is stored</h2>
  <p>
    The game servers run on Amazon Web Services in the United States. It is the only provider that
    processes game data. The connection is encrypted.
  </p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Play money</h2>
  <p>
    Bets in the game use play money. The app has no purchases, handles no real money and winnings cannot be
    exchanged for anything.
  </p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>The app is not directed at children under 13 and does not knowingly collect their data.</p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    Under Colombia's Law 1581 of 2012 and any other law that applies to you, you can ask us to tell you
    about, correct or delete your data. Since games delete themselves after {retention.gameHours} hours,
    there is usually nothing left. Write to <a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`}>{site.contactEmail}</a>
    and we will answer within 15 business days.
  </p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>If this policy changes, we will publish the new version on this page with its date.</p>
</section>
